sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant AG as Agent
    participant LLM as OpenAI
    participant MCP as MCP server
    participant API as Blog API

    User->>AG: "Show me post 9999, or list the drafts if it doesn't exist"
    AG->>LLM: messages + tools
    LLM-->>AG: tool_call get_post {post_id: 9999}
    AG->>MCP: tools/call get_post
    MCP->>API: GET /posts/9999
    API-->>MCP: 404 "Post 9999 not found"
    Note over MCP: ToolError, so the message is kept<br/>(other exceptions are masked)
    MCP-->>AG: isError: true, "404: Post 9999 not found"
    AG-->>User: SSE tool_result (is_error: true)

    AG->>LLM: messages + error result
    LLM-->>AG: tool_call list_posts {status: "draft"}
    AG->>MCP: tools/call list_posts
    MCP->>API: GET /posts?status=draft
    API-->>MCP: 200 [...]
    MCP-->>AG: result
    AG->>LLM: messages + result
    LLM-->>AG: "Post 9999 doesn't exist. Here are the drafts: ..."
    AG-->>User: tokens over SSE
